# Trivy ignore list — LexiSense
#
# Only vulnerabilities with NO fixed version available are listed here.
# Everything with a fix is remediated in frontend/package.json (resolutions)
# and frontend/yarn.lock, so it must NOT be suppressed.
#
# Each entry is a CVE/GHSA id, one per line. Trivy skips these findings when
# producing the SARIF that feeds the "Trivy" code-scanning check.

# node-forge: signature forgery in RSA PKCS#1 v1.5 verification.
# No fixed version published as of 2026-10-06 (upstream advisory open).
CVE-2026-85393

# braces: DoS via stack overflow from deeply nested patterns.
# No fixed version published as of 2026-10-06 (upstream advisory open).
CVE-2026-93687
